WHAT YOU MAY DO

  - Use this data pack in your own worlds and on your own servers, public
    or private, including servers with many players.
  - Read, study, and learn from the source. That is what it is here for.
  - Modify it, build on it, and share your modified version.
  - Include it in a modpack or map, as long as that modpack or map is not
    sold and is not placed behind payment.

  In all of the above, credit the original author (Thinnaphat) and link
  back to this project.


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

  - Sell this data pack, or any modified version of it.
  - Put it behind a paywall, a subscription, a "donate to download" gate,
    or a paid rank or perk on a server.
  - Place it behind a link shortener or ad-gate that earns you money.
  - Re-upload it as your own work without credit.

  In short: share it freely, learn from it freely, but do not make money
  from it.


PROJECT STATUS

  This is an early demo release — the first working version, published so
  that others can look at it and try it out. It is not a finished product.
  Behaviour, label wording, and file structure may all change in later
  versions, and updates may not be backwards compatible.

  The author intends to keep developing it.


NO WARRANTY

  This data pack is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It
  modifies no world data and alters no vanilla trading mechanics, but the
  author is not liable for any loss or damage arising from its use. Back
  up your world before installing any data pack.
